# Zalcano kills on the trip plaque: the trip starts on arriving in the prison, each kill comes from
# the game's kill count message and is logged per account, and the pet's message, a moment after
# the kill, joins that kill as a rare drop. Nothing here reads the fight itself.
# Schematic, not the real map: the prison is region 12126 (RuneLite's Discord plugin:
# BOSS_ZALCANO "Zalcano", 12126), so the scene only sits in it. Facts: Smolcano's message is
# "You have a funny feeling like you're being followed." (oldschool.runescape.wiki, Smolcano). The
# kill count message is unconfirmed for Zalcano (source: RuneLite's chat commands kill count
# pattern) and is the form core/Chat reads.
scene 3008 6016
skill MINING 80
skill SMITHING 80
skill HITPOINTS 70
item RUNE_PICKAXE "Rune pickaxe"
item SHARK "Shark"
items INV RUNE_PICKAXE 1
items INV SHARK 10
at 3034 6050
login
watch over tripPlaque.shown.over
watch title tripPlaque.shown.title
watch line0 tripPlaque.shown.lines.0.text
watch line1 tripPlaque.shown.lines.1.text
watch right1 tripPlaque.shown.lines.1.right
tick 2
expect over = "BOSS PILOT: ON A TRIP"
expect title = Zalcano
expect line0 ~ "0 kills in"
expect line1 = "Your first logged kill is next"

# The first kill: logged once its loot has had a few ticks to land; the walk in is not timed.
chat GAMEMESSAGE "Your Zalcano kill count is: 41."
tick 5
expect line0 ~ "1 kill in"
expect saved.zalcanoV1 ~ :41,           # the kill count, saved: "kc":41
expect line1 = "1 kill since a rare drop"
expect right1 = null

# The second, with the pet's message a tick after: it is that kill's, and the kill is timed.
chat GAMEMESSAGE "Your Zalcano kill count is: 42."
tick
chat GAMEMESSAGE "You have a funny feeling like you're being followed."
tick 5
expect line0 ~ "2 kills in"
expect saved.zalcanoV1 ~ Smolcano
expect line1 = "Your last kill brought a rare drop!"
expect right1 ~ "kills/hr"

# A third: the pet's dry spell starts again from it.
chat GAMEMESSAGE "Your Zalcano kill count is: 43."
tick 5
expect line1 = "1 kill since a rare drop"
expect saved.zalcanoV1 ~ :43,

# Leaving the prison: no trip, the log stays.
state LOGIN_SCREEN
tick
expect title = null
